---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Fonts" numeral="02">
  <section>
    <div class="summary">
      <h1>Aa</h1>
      <span class="uppercase"> Headings </span>
      <ul class="font-list">
        <li
          style='
                font-family: var(--fab-font-family-heading);
                font-feature-settings:
                  "salt" 1,
                  "dlig" 1;
              '>
          Quablo<span>Bold</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <span class="uppercase"> Body </span>
      <ul class="font-list">
        <li style="font-family: var(--fab-font-family-body); font-weight: 700">
          DM Sans<span>Bold</span>
        </li>
        <li style="font-family: var(--fab-font-family-body); font-weight: 500">
          DM Sans<span>Medium</span>
        </li>
        <li style="font-family: var(--fab-font-family-body)">DM Sans<span>Regular</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="headings">
        <h1>Heading 1</h1>
        <h2>Heading 2</h2>
        <h3>Heading 3</h3>
        <h4>Heading 4</h4>
        <h5>Heading 5</h5>
        <h6>Heading 6</h6>
      </div>
    </div>
      <div class="bodies">
        <span class="uppercase">Body - Default</span>
        <div>
          Far far away, behind the word mountains, far from the countries Vokalia and Consonantia,
          there live the blind texts. Separated they live in Bookmarksgrove right at the coast of
          the Semantics, a large language ocean.
        </div>

        <span class="uppercase">Body - Small</span>
        <div style="font-size: var(--fab-font-size-small)">
          Far far away, behind the word mountains, far from the countries Vokalia and Consonantia,
          there live the blind texts. Separated they live in Bookmarksgrove right at the coast of
          the Semantics, a large language ocean.
        </div>

        <span class="uppercase">Lead</span>
        <div class="lead">
          A small river named Duden flows by their place and supplies it with the necessary
          regelialia.
        </div>

        <span class="uppercase">Blockquote</span>
        <div class="blockquote">
          "One day however a small line of blind text by the name of Lorem Ipsum decided to leave
          for the far World of Grammar."
        </div>

        <span class="uppercase">Small</span>
        <div class="small">
          The Big Oxmox advised her not to do so, because there were thousands of bad Commas, wild
          Question Marks and devious Semikoli, but the Little Blind Text didn't listen.
        </div>

        <span class="uppercase">Tiny</span>
        <div class="tiny">
          She packed her seven versalia, put her initial into the belt and made herself on the way.
        </div>

        <span class="uppercase">Uppercase</span>
        <div class="uppercase" style="font-size: var(--fab-font-size-small); color: var(--fab-colour-text)">
          When she reached the first hills of the Italic Mountains...
        </div>

        <span class="uppercase">Small Label</span>
        <div class="small-label">
          she had a last view back on the skyline of her hometown Bookmarksgrove
        </div>

        <span class="uppercase">Medium Label</span>
        <div class="medium-label">
          the headline of Alphabet Village and the subline of her own road, the Line Lane.
        </div>

        <span class="uppercase">Large Label</span>
        <div class="large-label">Pityful a rethoric question ran over her cheek</div>
      </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: max-content max-content 1fr;
    gap: var(--fab-space-sm);
    padding: var(--fab-space-xl) var(--fab-space-lg);

    > *:not(.summary) {
      background-color: var(--fab-colour-background);
      border-radius: var(--fab-radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--fab-colour-border);
      box-shadow: var(--fab-elevation-02);
    }

    @container (width < 1200px) {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      .bodies {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }
    }
  }

  .summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    padding-block: var(--fab-space-md);
    align-content: start;
    padding-inline: var(--fab-space-xl);

    h1 {
      font-family: var(--fab-font-family-body);
      font-weight: var(--fab-font-weight-bold);
      text-transform: capitalize;
      color: var(--fab-colour-text-darker);
      margin-block-end: var(--fab-space-xl);
      margin-inline: auto;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--fab-colour-primary-lighter);
    }
  }

  .uppercase {
    opacity: 0.5;
    font-size: var(--fab-font-size-caption);
    padding-block-start: var(--fab-space-3xs);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .font-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin-block-start: var(--fab-space-2xs);
    margin-block-end: var(--fab-space-md);

    span {
      font-family: var(--fab-font-family-body);
      font-weight: var(--fab-font-weight-regular);
      padding-left: var(--fab-space-2xs);
    }
  }

  .headings {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--fab-space-sm);
    padding: var(--fab-space-lg) var(--fab-space-md);
  }

  .bodies {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--fab-space-sm) var(--fab-space-md);
    padding: var(--fab-space-lg);
  }
</style>
